# Test: web config editor on a daemon started with --plugin ze.flowspec-firewall refuses committing interface backend vpp at validation.
# Question: when a daemon runs with `--plugin ze.flowspec-firewall` and `--web`
#           on a `kernel` file and the web editor sets `interface backend vpp`
#           and posts `/config/commit/`, does `validateTransition` block the
#           commit with `commit blocked:` (not a runtime reload error), naming
#           `--plugin ze.flowspec-firewall` and `set firewall backend vpp`,
#           and leaving the stored configuration unchanged?
#           A unit test cannot prove the daemon's recorded `--plugin` reaches
#           the live HTTP `/config/commit/` -> `validateTransition` ->
#           `verifyTree` path.
# VALIDATES: spec-dataplane-compatibility-guard AC-18 (web editor door, A-16).
# PREVENTS: the web editor ignoring the daemon's `--plugin` arguments at
#           validation or staging a mismatched candidate for reload.

option=needs-linux:caps=net-admin
option=exclusive:group=flowspec-nft
option=needs-build-tag:value=ze_vpp:state=present
option=env:var=ze.config.dir:value=.
option=storage:value=disk
option=timeout:value=30s

tmpfs=dataplane-door-web.conf:terminator=EOF_CONF
interface {
	backend kernel;
}
EOF_CONF

tmpfs=set-backend-vpp.form:final-newline=false:terminator=EOF_SET
leaf=backend&value=vpp
EOF_SET

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze --plugin ze.flowspec-firewall start --web $PORT2 --insecure-web dataplane-door-web.conf:timeout=30s

http=wait:seq=1:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/config/edit/:status=200:insecure-tls=true:timeout=15s:contains=interface
http=post:seq=2:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/config/set/interface/:status=200:sendfile=set-backend-vpp.form:content-type=application/x-www-form-urlencoded:insecure-tls=true
http=post:seq=3:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/config/commit/:status=500:insecure-tls=true:contains=commit blocked:
http=post:seq=4:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/config/commit/:status=500:insecure-tls=true:contains=--plugin ze.flowspec-firewall
http=post:seq=5:url=https://127.0.0.1:$PORT2/config/commit/:status=500:insecure-tls=true:contains=set firewall backend vpp

reject=stderr:contains=reload error:
expect=file:path=dataplane-door-web.conf:contains=backend kernel
expect=file:path=dataplane-door-web.conf:not-contains=backend vpp
expect=key:path=meta/config/dataplane-door-web.conf/active:exists=true
expect=key:path=meta/config/dataplane-door-web.conf/candidate:absent=true
expect=key:glob=object/*:not-contains=backend vpp
